	"descriptionMarkdown": "Requirements: 60.5 Yumako/s, 24.20 Jellynut/s, 2976 Water/s. \n\nDivide by ~2.5 for the non-legendary version, check the blueprint description for the exact number.\n\nAbout 40Nutrients (optional if you have leftover spoilage laying around) and 8 Pentapod eggs to kickstart production. \n\nThe top right Science combinator \"E\" condition must be set to match your science buffer number of chest or higher.\n\nSee the Decider combinator description to the right of the Egg production for optional egg production killer.\n\nVarious decider combinator will prevent many unlikely scenario where production clog and cause Egg to hatch.\n\nFeatures:\n1) A stupid amount of circuit.\n2) Inserter galore.\n3) Mash and Jelly on belt for the lulz.\n4) UPS killer (probably, I don't know really).\n5) Tileable but you need to supply extra Yumako.\n\nMy greatest shame: Not being to reduce Yumako usage under 60/s to allow 2 blueprint to run off a single belt. \n\nLet me know if you see any way to make it happen.\n\nIf you see any mistake or scenario where clogging can happen, let me know!",
